# A builtin that takes a function and computes a value from it has no
# effect when the function has none (D141): `map` builds a list to drop
# it. With a function that has an effect it is a pass for that effect,
# as `each` and a `for` statement are.
xs = [1, 2]
each(xs, x => print(x))
for x in xs: print(x) ;;
map(xs, x => print(x))
map(xs, x => x * 2)
# expect-error: E0234
